// Feature switches (release 1.11): every feature added since release 1.4 can be turned off, hospital-wide, in
// Admin → Features. A feature that is off is hidden in the screens (its screen, tab or button), its API routes answer
// 403 feature_off, and it stops acting (a check that no longer runs, a scan that is no longer asked for).
//
// This file is the list (pure data: settings.ts makes a setting of each, feature-gate.ts reads them). Most features
// have their own setting, feature.<key>; a few use the switch they already had (auth.badge_login, sync.trim_copies).
// The plan's numbers (docs/STATUS.md history) are kept so a feature can be found in the plan.
